  "text": "Risen Ghosts\n\nIntroduction\nRisen Ghosts are generally only killed for the Ultimate Slayer title. Otherwise, the XP and GP/hr are mediocre at best.\n​\nStats\n⬥  level: 85\n⬥  XP per kill: 1000\n⬥ Optimal kills per hour: 800  720 \n⬥ Optimal  XP per hour: 800k  720k \n​\nDesirable drops\n⬥ Greater Sonic Wave ability codex \n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Required for the Slayer collection log\n⬥ Ghost Hunter equipment  1/2000 for any piece\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Required for the Slayer collection log\n​\nLocation and Positioning\nRisen Ghosts can be found in the Crypt North of Fort Forinthry after the question Unwelcome Guests is complete.\n​\nFor both methods, place an  in the tile shown and stand underneath it.\n​\n\n​\nMethod: AFK Magic \n⬥ Pray  and  or \n⬥ Sustain  with \n⬥ Ensure   are active\n⬥ Autocast \n⬥ Cast \n​\nPresets and Relics\n​\n⬥ Magic preset \n​\n​\n\nAbility Bar\n\n⬥ Replace  with  if on task/using wildcards\n⬥ Cast  if low HP\n​\nMethod: AFK Necromancy \n⬥ Pray  and  or \n⬥ Sustain  with  and \n⬥ Ensure   are active\n⬥ Do not use \n​\nPresets and Relics\n​\n⬥ Necromancy preset \n​\n​\n\nAbility Bar\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Risen Ghosts Introduction Risen Ghosts are generally only killed for the Ultimate Slayer title. Otherwise, the XP and GP/hr are mediocre at best. ​ Stats ⬥ level: 85 ⬥ XP per kill: 1000 ⬥ Optimal kills per hour: 800 720 ⬥ Optimal XP per hour: 800k 720k ​ Desirable drops ⬥ Greater Sonic Wave ability codex ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Required for the Slayer collection log ⬥ Ghost Hunter equipment 1/2000 for any piece ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Required for the Slayer collection log ​ Location and Positioning Risen Ghosts can be found in the Crypt North of Fort Forinthry after the question Unwelcome Guests is complete. ​ For both methods, place an in the tile shown and stand underneath it. ​ ​ Method: AFK Magic ⬥ Pray and or ⬥ Sustain with ⬥ Ensure are active ⬥ Autocast ⬥ Cast ​ Presets and Relics ​ ⬥ Magic preset ​ ​ Ability Bar ⬥ Replace with if on task/using wildcards ⬥ Cast if low HP ​ Method: AFK Necromancy ⬥ Pray and or ⬥ Sustain with and ⬥ Ensure are active ⬥ Do not use ​ Presets and Relics ​ ⬥ Necromancy preset ​ ​ Ability Bar ​",
